            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Konye kwana ener EJAKAIT ebe, “Eroko ketuboro ikar iuni, kwape ikar luka ŋol kaloiswamai eropit, kitisilio aibuses naka Moab kekodeteke kere loepol; luasalitos da luikidioko cut, komam kepodoi araut ibore cut.”",
          "type": "text",
